      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STREAMLINED (2) ran over the top to score impressively over the mile last start and the rise to 1800m is no issue. Drawn out again, but he's a nice horse on the way up and he doesn't appear to have hit the ceiling just yet. Can raise the bar again. VEXATIOUS ROSE (4) missed as favourite last start but was good in defeat, missing by 2.4L. That form has already been franked, and this shapes similarly to her latest efforts. Can make her presence felt again. CLASSIC IMPACT (6) is ticking along nicely without winning and looks primed for the rise in trip now. She carries no weight today after Tsang's claim and she maps to get every chance in the run. Can put her best foot forward. AWESOME FORCE (5) was solid in defeat at this track and trip last week. Likely to get back in the run but if she runs up to his latest effort, she can feature. MORE THAN ENUFF (1) beat AWESOME FORCE last start, and he can play a leading role.",
